Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:19:37 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1095/1259] The Takes column's filters in every room, hidden
 ones too (1125); the datasheet's score as a folded staff (1126); the
 workspaces column scrolls on its own, the Takes column past the log box
 (1127); the datasheet shows LoRAs and sliders with their strengths (1128)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css              |  26 +++++++++++++
 tools/console/app.js               |  30 +++++++++++++--
 tools/console/heresy-collection.js |  59 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 tools/console/index.html           |   7 ++++
 tools/public/index.html.gz         | Bin 468878 -> 471303 bytes
 5 files changed, 116 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 9f78a3a..d7b7ae1 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -3139,3 +3139,29 @@ input[type="search"]::-webkit-search-cancel-button { cursor: pointer; }
   .ds-texts > * { flex: none; }
   .ds-texts .ds-lyrics { flex: 1 1 0; height: 0; min-height: 240px; max-height: none !important; }
 }
+
+/* HERESY 1125: the Takes column's filters: a dot on the ⋯ while one is on; a hidden take shown faded */
+.menu-cap { padding: 6px 12px 2px; font: 600 10.5px/1.2 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); }
+.menu-sep { height: 1px; margin: 4px 8px; background: var(--line-a); }
+#libMenuBtn.has-filter { position: relative; color: var(--amber); }
+#libMenuBtn.has-filter::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 3px; right: 3px; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--amber); }
+.take.is-hidden-take { opacity: .55; }
+.take.is-hidden-take .take-title::after { content: " · hidden"; font-weight: 400; color: var(--dim); font-size: .85em; }
+/* HERESY 1126: the datasheet's score: a staff, folded until asked for */
+.ds-score { margin-top: 8px; }
+.ds-score > summary, .ds-abc-raw > summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: revert; }
+.ds-score > summary em { font-style: normal; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--dim); margin-left: 6px; }
+.ds-staff { padding: 6px 4px; background: var(--paper, var(--panel)); border-radius: var(--r-md); overflow-x: auto; }
+.ds-staff svg { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
+.ds-abc-raw { margin-top: 6px; }
+
+/* HERESY 1127: the workspaces column scrolls on its own (its height is set by the page, down to the server log) */
+.coll-side { overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: var(--line-a) transparent; }
+
+/* HERESY 1127: the floating server log (bottom right, above the player) covered the end of the Takes column in the
+   Creator, the Writer and the Refiner; the column now scrolls past it, as the rooms always did (their 60 px) */
+#libList { padding-bottom: 66px; }
+
+/* HERESY 1128: the datasheet's sliders and LoRAs: a long name wraps, its strength stays on the right */
+.ds-kv-long span { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
+.ds-kv-long b { flex: none; white-space: nowrap; }
